OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FFeeling fresher today with
OL,6,Fsunny spells and scattered showers.
OL,7,FThese showers may be heavy at times,
OL,8,Fmainly over the hills. Strong, gusty
OL,9,Fwinds with isolated gales along coasts
OL,10,Finitially, these slowly easing through
OL,11,Fthe day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FShowers becoming more
OL,14,Fisolated for a time this evening
OL,15,Fbefore an organised band sweeps
OL,16,Fthrough in the early hours. Winds ease
OL,17,Ffor most, away from the far northwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
