OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FPatchy cloud and sunny
OL,6,Fspells with some isolated showers at
OL,7,Ffirst, these dying out through the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Feeling pleasant in any
OL,9,Fsunny spells with light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,12,Fsettled end to the week with sunny
OL,13,Fspells and light winds each day, and
OL,14,Ffog patches forming each night. Cloud
OL,15,Fbuilding with light rain possible by
OL,16,FSaturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
